yle="font-weight: bold;">- Rp ' + data.diskon.toLocaleString('id-ID') + '</span></div><hr style="border: 1px solid #666; margin: 15px 0;"><div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-weight: bold; font-size: 20px; color: #f97316;"><span>Total Pembayaran:</span><span>Rp ' + data.total.toLocaleString('id-ID') + '</span></div></div></div></div><div class="footer"><p style="font-weight: bold;">Roti Daiki - Roti Segar Setiap Hari</p></div><div class="no-print"><button onclick="window.print()" class="btn btn-primary">Print Kwitansi</button><button onclick="window.close()" class="btn btn-secondary">Tutup</button></div></div></body></html>';
            
